            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Sort photos by condition (most degraded first), then by importance (unique photos of people who have passed, rare group portraits). Scan in batches at 600 DPI, name files systematically (e.g., last name + year + description), and restore the highest-priority photos first.",
