              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Remini is the better pick if you want a mobile app with strong daily-use enhancement features and don't mind a recurring subscription. MyHeritage Photo Enhancer is better if you already use MyHeritage for genealogy or want its Photo subscription for all its AI photo tools. Neither is the cheapest option for users who only want photo restoration — that's typically Magic Memory at €9.99 one-time for 20 credits.",
              },
              "name": "Remini vs MyHeritage Photo Enhancer in 2026: which is better?",
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Both deliver strong face restoration results. Magic Memory uses GFPGAN, a model published in peer-reviewed research (CVPR 2021) specifically designed for face restoration. Remini uses a proprietary model. For portrait and face restoration specifically, both produce high-quality results. The meaningful differences are pricing, platform, and privacy — not raw restoration quality.",
              },
              "name": "Remini vs Magic Memory: which has better photo restoration quality?",
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
