                "text": "For a handful of photos, Magic Memory usually costs least. Remini and MyHeritage both charge a recurring subscription for as long as you keep it. A user restoring 10–20 photos pays €9.99 once on Magic Memory (the 20-credit Starter pack, credits never expire); 50 photos fit in the €19.99 Growth pack.",
              },
              "name": "Which is cheaper for 10–20 photos: Remini, MyHeritage, or Magic Memory?",
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Magic Memory works in Safari on iPhone — no app download required. Sign in with Google and upload photos directly from your camera roll. Remini requires the iOS or Android app. MyHeritage has a mobile app but the photo enhancer also works in the browser if you have a paid plan.",
              },
              "name": "Can you use Magic Memory or Remini on iPhone?",
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Magic Memory has no free tier: each restoration uses one credit from a one-time pack (from €9.99 for 20), and a failed restoration costs no credit. Remini offers limited free trials (typically ~3 enhances before paywall).",
