                "text": "Yes — Magic Memory is a non-subscription, web-based alternative to Remini for AI face restoration. The differences: Magic Memory is built for the browser, Remini is best known as a phone app; Magic Memory is one-time credits that never expire, Remini is a recurring in-app subscription; Magic Memory does not keep your photos after processing.",
