              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Magic Memory is significantly easier. It is a one-click tool: upload a photo, AI restores it, usually in under a minute, download the result. VanceAI offers a professional suite with multiple tools, settings, and options. If you just want to restore old photos quickly, Magic Memory has zero learning curve. If you need advanced controls like upscaling parameters or batch processing, VanceAI has more options.",
