              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Magic Memory is cheaper for occasional users. The smallest credit pack is €9.99 for 20 credits that never expire. VanceAI's monthly plans start at $15/month billed yearly for 260 credits a month (vanceai.com/pricing, 2026-11-16), and it gives 10 credits to try.",
              },
              "name": "Which is cheaper for occasional use: Magic Memory or VanceAI?",
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
